        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eleanor McGovern, George McGovern\n- Roles: Wife, U.S. Representative, U.S. Senator, historian, author, Democratic presidential nominee\n- Places: South Dakota\n- Events: 1972 presidential election\n\nFacts:\n- Eleanor Fay Stegeberg McGovern was born on November 25, 1921, and died on January 25, 2007.\n- George Stanley McGovern was born on July 19, 1922, and died on October 21, 2012.\n- Eleanor McGovern was the wife of George McGovern.\n- George McGovern was an American historian, author, U.S. Representative, and U.S. Senator.\n- George McGovern served as a U.S. Senator from South Dakota from 1963 to 1981.\n- George McGovern was the Democratic Party presidential nominee in the 1972 presidential election.",
